  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting a sustainable and locally-led community based policing in the Kyrgyz Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this award is to build sustainable support and cooperation between citizens and security providers, so that the community policing approach is being successfully implemented by Community Policing Partnership Teams (CPPT), based on multi-year, strategic Local Crime Prevention Center&#x2019;s (LCPC) plans, and is institutionalized in local and national governments&#x2019; agendas.</narrative>
  </description>
